414070441", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585720338_2300745417403774_3453430364923610160_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9ca7Dxc3sfgQ7kNvwFrPEWK&_nc_oc=AdrzZjwHcjTCXX49JPcADQefIFbAADr5bVZVHenTC21mMEBel_elzMETjmLqoFizNQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEmCK65KcEAHYHiDNJxjWNjZDkN5dxyhenJipy4UZ_DSQ&oe=6A8ACA05"}, {"file_name": "trailer_Custom..._17.08.2026_12-35-41.png", "id": "1411656457502511", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_1411656460835844_4020521439160498607_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mLIm3W22e38Q7kNvwHiMEWI&_nc_oc=AdpGr8dqAvVmqQPqz2_xWL7uWoRTOHx1V-CUFOpn6d9tjKaslCFljVppP_qntmasRhg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE50Jp6guF8oeeLprAgalVKY8Gklv2qui9UlcIh0gccUA&oe=6A8AED33"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "13952.png", "id": "1292362036219293", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1292362046219292_3703806738160145125_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rPSctMIFu_oQ7kNvwEHNE6t&_nc_oc=Adov0F4SsB_4YjH9eAS5o41aQjawmRb_0hlOOh2blFXkkBmYlUEgxBqdtGeGRCIHbKU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFdnnXpZtfV9Enl-LFkkk-CN3zsGPK1JiGHXCNm8yzVYA&oe=6A8AEABC"}, "display_name": "Cube Deluxe", "keywords": ["Runners", "Cube", "Cubic", "Bouncers", "Deluxe"], "long_description": "Cube Deluxe is a community-driven project made with the help of our fans and the same developers behind the original game released on itch.io. Inspired by Cube Runners and its different gamemodes, Cube Deluxe brings new ways to play, explore, and cause chaos.\n\nExperience the Gamemodes\n\nNo Mod Stuff Mode: Play casually with none of the mod features.\nPlay With Friends: Enjoy Cube Deluxe together with your friends.\nMod Stuff Mode: Summon entities and experiment with crazy features.\nChaos Mode: Become the entities and cause chaos yourself.\nOffline Mode: Play completely offline if you don't have anyone to play with.\n\nCosmetics\n\nBuy and collect cosmetics to customize your character and make your appearance unique.\n\nHorror Mode\n\nHorror Mode introduces 14 brand-new levels filled with darker environments, terrifying entities, strange events, and hidden secrets. Explore every corner and try to survive what waits inside.\n\nBut there is more than just horror. Cube Deluxe contains secret lore hidden throughout the game. Look carefully, explore unusual places, and pay attention to the smallest details. You may uncover secrets that reveal what is really happening behind the game.\n\nCan you discover all the secrets and uncover the complete story?\n\nPlay the game, explore the levels, summon entities, become the entities, survive Horror Mode, and uncover the hidden lore.\n\nThis game is approved by Tom Pearl.", "short_description": "Cube Deluxe is an project that was was made with the help of the fans and same devs of the original old game that we made also its inspired by cube runners for the idea of the gamemodes\nExperience the Gamemodes\nBuy cosmetics "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://kahlemich-production.jimdosite.com/privacy-poiicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://kahlemich-production.jimdosite.com/terms-of-services/", "publisher_name": "Kahlemich ", "support_website_url": "https://kahlemich-production.jimdosite.com/external-support/", "website_url": "https://kahlemich-production.jimdosite.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area"